"<div id=\"main\" class=\"home-page\"><section class=\"wrap split pb-16 pt-8 md:pb-20 md:pt-12\" data-hero><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Workplace credentials &amp; compliance</p><h1 class=\"display text-[clamp(2.2rem,3.8vw,3.5rem)]\">Manage workforce<br><span class=\"text-blue\">compliance in<br>one place.</span></h1><p class=\"copy mt-2\">Give HR and compliance teams one place to manage worker credentials, company records and expiry dates. Connect that view to the records people hold and the sites they attend.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"/contact/\" data-demo-cta=\"true\">Book a demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"link\" href=\"#onboard\">See how it works <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"hero-visual hero-app-capture figure\" data-demo-slot=\"index.hero\"><div class=\"app-capture-chrome\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" alt=\"Example Certifyd company workspace showing care roles and evidence requirements\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\"><figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">Set up role requirements in the company workspace.</figcaption></figure></section><div class=\"relative\"><nav aria-label=\"The workforce journey\" class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 border-y border-line bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"wrap chapter-nav flex justify-between\"><a href=\"#onboard\" data-chapter-link=\"onboard\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">01</span><span>Onboard</span></a><a href=\"#track\" data-chapter-link=\"track\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">02</span><span>Track</span></a><a href=\"#oversee\" data-chapter-link=\"oversee\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">03</span><span>Oversee</span></a><a href=\"#carry\" data-chapter-link=\"carry\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">04</span><span>Carry</span></a><a href=\"#arrive\" data-chapter-link=\"arrive\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">05</span><span>Arrive</span></a></div></nav><div class=\"wrap\"><section id=\"record-ownership\" class=\"split border-b border-line py-12 md:py-16\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Your team. Your people. Clear responsibilities.</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Manage company records.<br>View the workforce on one screen.</h2><p class=\"copy\">See what matters for work while keeping personal credentials and company records distinct.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col divide-y divide-line\"><div class=\"pb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Set requirements and review evidence.</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate\">Set role requirements, review worker evidence and maintain inductions, policies and review history in the company workspace.</p></div><div class=\"py-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Let workers share their credentials.</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate\">Workers store their qualifications and certificates in their own app, then share the evidence needed for work.</p></div><div class=\"pt-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">See company and shared worker records.</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate\">Follow company records and shared credentials alongside dates, review status and site activity. Access depends on what is shared and the person’s role.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"onboard\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">01 / Onboarding</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Set role requirements.<br>Bring your people in.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Define the evidence each role needs. Invite workers to contribute their credentials and bring existing company-held records into the review process.</p><a href=\"/outcomes/import-compliance-records/\" class=\"cta\">Explore onboarding <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\" data-demo-slot=\"index.figure-1\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">01 / Role requirements</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-5 text-blue\">Start with the role</p><h3 class=\"mb-1 text-2xl font-semibold\">Care assistant</h3><p class=\"mb-5 text-sm text-slate\">Your requirements shape the record.</p><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Workplace induction</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Set by your organisation</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Manual handling</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Evidence and expiry date</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Identity document</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Review by your team</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"track\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">02 / Tracked records</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Track expiry dates.<br>Plan the next renewal.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Record expiry and review dates against worker credentials and company documents. See what needs attention in the documents that back it up.</p><a href=\"/platform/records/\" class=\"cta\">Explore tracked records <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\" data-demo-slot=\"index.figure-2\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">02 / Tracked record</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><div class=\"pt-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Manual handling</h3><span class=\"badge bg-cream text-amber\">Due for renewal</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate\">Expiry date: 30 November 2026</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-8 border-t-2 border-blue pt-6\"><span class=\"absolute -top-2 right-[22%] h-3.5 w-3.5 border-[3px] border-white bg-blue\"></span><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate\"><p>Added to record</p><p class=\"text-right font-semibold text-amber\">Renewal approaching</p></div></div></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"oversee\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">03 / Workforce overview</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Spot missing evidence.<br>Prioritise the next review.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Give HR and compliance teams a view of missing evidence, pending reviews and approaching renewals. Open the relevant record to see what your team needs to do.</p><a href=\"/outcomes/reduce-compliance-risk/\" class=\"cta\">Find and fix compliance gaps <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\" data-demo-slot=\"index.figure-3\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / Workforce overview</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3 border-b border-line pb-5\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Workforce overview</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold\">What needs attention?</h3></div><span class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Your team</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Manual handling</p></div><span class=\"badge bg-cream text-amber\">Renewal due</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Alex Morgan</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Workplace induction</p></div><span class=\"badge\">Awaiting review</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Riley Ellis</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Requested evidence</p></div><span class=\"badge\">Missing</span></div></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"carry\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">04 / The worker app</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Let people carry<br>their own credentials.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Workers keep their personal qualifications and certificates in the app and share the evidence needed for work. Your company maintains its own records, including inductions and reviews.</p><a href=\"/outcomes/portable-worker-credentials/\" class=\"cta\">Explore the worker app <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\" data-demo-slot=\"index.figure-4\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">04 / Worker app</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"phone\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-6 h-1.5 w-12 rounded-full bg-ink\"></div><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center justify-between\"><img src=\"/images/connected/logo.svg\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" alt=\"Certifyd\"><span class=\"text-xs text-slate\">My records</span></div><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-xl font-semibold\">Keep your credentials.<br>Share what you need.</h3><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Manual handling</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Your certificate</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Personal</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">North site induction</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Company-held record</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Company</span></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-6 h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-ink\"></div></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"arrive\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">05 / Site check-in</p><h2 class=\"heading\">See who has checked in.<br>Review the visit history.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Record when people check in and out of each site. See who has checked in, review visit times and open the attendance history.</p><a href=\"/outcomes/verified-worker-check-in/\" class=\"cta\">Explore site check-in <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\" data-demo-slot=\"index.figure-5\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">05 / Site attendance</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><div class=\"my-6 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 border-blue text-3xl text-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↳</span><div><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">North site</p><h3 id=\"attendance-state\" class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold\">On site now</h3></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-line pt-5\"><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Check-in</p><p class=\"font-mono text-lg\">08:02</p></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Check-out</p><p id=\"checkout-time\" class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Not yet recorded</p></div></div><button id=\"attendance-preview\" class=\"demo-choice mt-5 w-full\" aria-pressed=\"false\">See the check-out record →</button><p id=\"attendance-announcement\" role=\"status\" class=\"sr-only\"></p></div></div></figure></section></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section id=\"solutions\" class=\"split border-b border-line py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Explore the workflows</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Explore each workflow<br>in more detail.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Open the full pages to see how imports, evidence reviews, renewals, worker credentials and site check-in work.</p><p class=\"max-w-[40ch] border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Manage each workflow against your people and their records.</p></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-line border-y border-line\"><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/outcomes/reduce-compliance-risk/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-blue\">Close compliance gaps</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Find missing evidence and follow the review.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/outcomes/import-compliance-records/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-blue\">Bring your records across</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Start with the worker spreadsheet you already use.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/outcomes/reduce-compliance-admin/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-blue\">Reduce the daily chasing</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Keep requests, reviews and renewals in view.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/outcomes/verified-worker-check-in/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-blue\">Follow site attendance</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">See who checked in, where and when.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/outcomes/portable-worker-credentials/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-blue\">Give people their own record</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Connect personal credentials to company requirements.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></section><section id=\"industries\" class=\"split py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Explore your industry</p><h2 class=\"heading\">See how Certifyd<br>fits your workplace.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Explore the records and day-to-day checks your team needs to manage.</p></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-line border-y border-line\"><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/industries/care/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Care</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Manage staff evidence, renewals and care-site attendance.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/industries/recruitment/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Recruitment</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Review worker evidence before the next placement.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/industries/nhs/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">NHS</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Follow workforce requirements and evidence reviews.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/industries/trades/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Trades and home visits</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Let customers scan a worker’s shared work profile.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"solution-row group\" href=\"/industries/workforce/\"><span><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Other workforce teams</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Manage role requirements across teams and sites.</span></span><span class=\"text-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></section></div><section id=\"demo\" class=\"bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-24\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#93BBFF]\">See the connected workflow</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Review your workforce<br>records in a demo.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[43ch] text-lg text-white/80\">Bring a role and the records you manage today. In 20 minutes, we’ll walk through your requirements, the team’s view and how people contribute their evidence.</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"/contact/\" data-demo-cta=\"true\">Book a demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></section></div>"
